 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Simple, ask politely. You could say, Please let me get few words out before you jump in. Do you want ten minutes or half an hour? Then explain how it affects you, maybe something you did together recently she remembers. Did she smile because you sang dumb songs, or did your little one make her cry? Then stick with that. After dinner, before her bath, no interrupts. Him too. He probably doesn't realise how it affects you. Ask for the same time every day, that way it becomes habit.",
